      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The reason we have the \"animated\" toggle as an option that's off by default is because it costs a bit more performance to allow animation.\nIf all Dynamic Bone conversions to PhysBones automatically have that Animated flag on, we're going to take a significant performance hit. We'd like to avoid that.\nIn implementations like this, it is generally desired that the avatar author go and upload a converted version, so you can tweak these values properly yourself.\nIt isn't a zero-work solution, but does this work for you?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
