  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Almost all of my avatars rely on dynamic bones being animatable, (tail pose, tongue blep, wing flap, etc.). I assume this is due to the new \"Animated\" checkbox defaulting to off for auto conversions.\nCurrently:\nAll auto converted DynBones > physBones ignore all animations.\nDesired:\nWhen auto converted, PhysBones should allow for animations (\"Animated\" should be enabled), for maximum compatibility with the behavior of DynBones.",
